    <briefdescription>
<para>Conflict analysis captured at time of incident. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tracks write-write conflicts and retry counts to help operators understand contention patterns.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>conflict_count &gt;= 0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>retry_count &gt;= 0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Both fields are optional for non-conflict incidents </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
